@base = http://localhost:8080
@warehouse = eeeeeeee-0000-4000-8000-000000000001
@userId = replace-with-user-id
@csrf = replace-with-request-token-after-login
@dishId = replace-with-dish-id
@key = 22222222-2222-4222-8222-222222222222

### Runtime / readiness
GET {{base}}/api/v2/runtime

### CSRF cookie/request token before login
GET {{base}}/api/v2/auth/csrf

### Login: replace password/token; retain cookies in HTTP client
POST {{base}}/api/v2/auth/login
Origin: http://localhost:8080
X-CSRF-TOKEN: {{csrf}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"username":"demo-owner","password":"replace-with-Demo__Password"}

### Refresh token after login
GET {{base}}/api/v2/auth/csrf

### Catalog, stock, offers
GET {{base}}/api/v2/warehouses/{{warehouse}}/dishes?pageSize=100

###
GET {{base}}/api/v2/warehouses/{{warehouse}}/inventory

### Preview
POST {{base}}/api/v2/warehouses/{{warehouse}}/orders/preview
Origin: http://localhost:8080
X-CSRF-TOKEN: {{csrf}}
X-Rims-Expected-User-Id: {{userId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"lines":[{"dishId":"{{dishId}}","portions":2}]}

### Create; repeat exact request/key after a lost response
POST {{base}}/api/v2/warehouses/{{warehouse}}/orders
Origin: http://localhost:8080
X-CSRF-TOKEN: {{csrf}}
X-Rims-Expected-User-Id: {{userId}}
Idempotency-Key: {{key}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"lines":[{"dishId":"{{dishId}}","portions":2}]}

### Changed body + same key -> 409 IDEMPOTENCY_KEY_REUSED
POST {{base}}/api/v2/warehouses/{{warehouse}}/orders
Origin: http://localhost:8080
X-CSRF-TOKEN: {{csrf}}
X-Rims-Expected-User-Id: {{userId}}
Idempotency-Key: {{key}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"lines":[{"dishId":"{{dishId}}","portions":1}]}

### Ledger / history / current stop
GET {{base}}/api/v2/warehouses/{{warehouse}}/movements

###
GET {{base}}/api/v2/warehouses/{{warehouse}}/orders

###
GET {{base}}/api/v2/warehouses/{{warehouse}}/stop-list
